tamp seconds \"tmUSec\" -- timestamp microseconds \"inclLen\" -- number of octets/bytes of packet in the pcap file \"origLen\" -- number of octets/byets of packet on the network (will be same as inclLen unless bigger than snapLen  Sample output format: (newlines don't matter here. Also, order of fields in {...}  don't matter. ","topics":[],"score":221173,"global_rank":182116},{"name":"nwager/enclosure-controller","owner":"nwager","html_url":"https://github.com/nwager/enclosure-controller","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Controller for my 3D printer enclosure. Controls lighting and filter fan speed.","topics":[],"score":221171,"global_rank":182145},{"name":"anthonycabreralara/kaleidoscope","owner":"anthonycabreralara","html_url":"https://github.com/anthonycabreralara/kaleidoscope","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":221170,"global_rank":182171},{"name":"Symbitic/qtwebplugin","owner":"Symbitic","html_url":"https://github.com/Symbitic/qtwebplugin","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Experimental QPA for accessing Qt/QML applications in a web browser.","topics":[],"score":221170,"global_rank":182172},{"name":"axelmagn/learn-opengl","owner":"axelmagn","html_url":"https://github.com/axelmagn/learn-opengl","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":221170,"global_rank":182173},{"name":"Naveen-Lalwani/High-Performance-ID3-Decision-Trees","owner":"Naveen-Lalwani","html_url":"https://github.com/Naveen-Lalwani/High-Performance-ID3-Decision-Trees","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Design of high performance kernels for ID3 Decision Tree algorithm for Intel Broadwell Architecture using SIMD instructions, compiler optimizations and cache aware implementations.","topics":[],"score":221164,"global_rank":182195},{"name":"matteing/nomina","o